{"4117850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Quiet House in Flatbush", "steam_appid": 4117850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4827470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/cfaa822a6b63bfdda0e8503ad2831674.poster.avif?t=1781631869\" width=684 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/cfaa822a6b63bfdda0e8503ad2831674.webm?t=1781631869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/cfaa822a6b63bfdda0e8503ad2831674.mp4?t=1781631869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Quiet House in Flatbush</strong> is a survival retro VHS horror game where you are to escape a serial killer's house of horror! collect items, use your ingenuity to solve puzzles, bypass traps and overcome obstacles, evade the killer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/0975422d7883da37a98a4af141b113ae.avif?t=1781631869\" width=500 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Based on real events</i></strong> <br><br><strong>A Quiet House in Flatbush</strong> is set in 1992 Brooklyn. You play a young woman abducted on her walk home through Flatbush, waking up in a dungeon beneath a house in Albemarle Terrace — a real hidden enclave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house belongs to a killer. The game is about surviving it. That's the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface: this is a game about what it means to confront the situation at hand rather than look away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who pays attention will find that the house is not just a place to survive. It is a portrait of a person, assembled piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vibe, graphics and atmosphere of the game is inspired by the PS1 era of games as well as the 80s era of slasher films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The soundtrack &amp; FX is made purely on analog equipment by Tater Andersson. <br>Capturing the essence of John Carpenter's synth work as well as being influenced by Oslo's noise underground scene in Norway.<br><br>//GAME IS CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT//</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/cfaa822a6b63bfdda0e8503ad2831674.poster.avif?t=1781631869\" width=684 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/cfaa822a6b63bfdda0e8503ad2831674.webm?t=1781631869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/cfaa822a6b63bfdda0e8503ad2831674.mp4?t=1781631869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Quiet House in Flatbush</strong> is a survival retro VHS horror game where you are to escape a serial killer's house of horror! collect items, use your ingenuity to solve puzzles, bypass traps and overcome obstacles, evade the killer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/extras/0975422d7883da37a98a4af141b113ae.avif?t=1781631869\" width=500 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Based on real events</i></strong> <br><br><strong>A Quiet House in Flatbush</strong> is set in 1992 Brooklyn. You play a young woman abducted on her walk home through Flatbush, waking up in a dungeon beneath a house in Albemarle Terrace — a real hidden enclave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house belongs to a killer. The game is about surviving it. That's the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface: this is a game about what it means to confront the situation at hand rather than look away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who pays attention will find that the house is not just a place to survive. It is a portrait of a person, assembled piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vibe, graphics and atmosphere of the game is inspired by the PS1 era of games as well as the 80s era of slasher films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The soundtrack &amp; FX is made purely on analog equipment by Tater Andersson. <br>Capturing the essence of John Carpenter's synth work as well as being influenced by Oslo's noise underground scene in Norway.<br><br>//GAME IS CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT//</p>", "short_description": "Based on real events: A Quiet House in Flatbush is a survival retro VHS horror game where you are trying to escape from a serial killer's house of horror - collect items, use your ingenuity to solve puzzles, bypass traps and overcome obstacles, evade the killer who is stalking the halls and escape!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117850/8dc6f8f4e0cbbeb8e4f7fbd8b7b4d81de15cda67/header.jpg?t=1781631869",